                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So today I played this one for a bit. Not very excited about this first play. The population was dying off, I think before I quit, there some 4000 left on the ship. Horrible. So, I think the learning curve is not easy, the control of game event and best course of action was not intuitive. So I think I need to read the manual. I have get to studying, and then I get back to it. I don't think the general gamer is going to get into it. So the reviews were not encouraging. So we'll see.\nI have to make a recommendation either way at this point. I cannot be neutral on this review, so I'll put thumb down for now until things change.",
